+   - Reachable outputs visibly end with the black/random-colored L nested inside the red frame.
+     Stuck outputs leave the frame empty and stop the mover earlier on the river.
 
 f) Visual cleanliness
-   - Only four semantic regions are present: background, river, mover color, dock color.
-   - The tip is a single extra pixel on the mover, never overprinted on the dock.
-   - The dock stays a single monochromatic frame component; the cavity remains plain blue,
