-   - The anchor path is constructed in bbox top-left coordinates, so every translated L
-     stays in bounds.
-   - The dock anchor is placed one cell in from an outer edge. That leaves room for the
-     outer frame border and keeps the cavity inside the grid.
-   - The dock mask is painted only after the blue path exists; the cavity and mouth are
