-   - "Lower color is the mover" is false. Object colors are randomized, so role detection
-     must come from shape.
-   - "Feasible if an n×n window is fully traversable" is false. Only the translated L
-     cells matter; background may remain inside the bbox.
-   - "Destination color is traversable" is false. Dock frame pixels are walls; only the
-     blue cavity and mouth are passable.
-   - "Erase / paint whole n×n rectangles" is false. Only the body cells move; the tip is
